8004E880 CardFastTrackWaitPatch — Waits for the card busy bit to clear when required then resumes the saved fast-track continuation; otherwise it returns immediately.
8004E8D8 _patch_card — Installs the card fast-track wait path into kernel memory under a critical section and flushes the instruction cache.
8004E960 CardHandlerDelayTrampoline — Executes the displaced card-handler instructions then waits 200 decrement iterations before returning.
8004E990 _patch_card2 — Atomically swaps the card-handler prologue with the delay trampoline and flushes the instruction cache so repeated execution toggles installation.
8004E9FC CardLongBusyDelay — Spins on a decrementing counter initialized to 0x320000 before returning.
8004EA20 _ExitCard — Replaces three kernel card-exit instructions with no-operations under a critical section then flushes the instruction cache.
